course: dictionary
lesson: 2054
title: Careful and conscientious
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A conscientious person takes care to do their work well and does it properly, because they want to do the right thing. It is a long word, but the words around it give clues.
explain: «School reports use formal words: "conscientious" means careful and hard-working.» A school report is praising the pupil, so conscientious must be a good thing. Try the swap test: a conscientious pupil checks their work and hands in homework on time.
explain: Stories use it too. If a character is conscientious, the reader knows they can be trusted to finish the job properly.
explain: Conscientious has a second meaning about right and wrong. A conscientious objector refuses to fight in a war because they believe fighting is wrong. You will meet this in history lessons about the World Wars.
fact: Conscientious means careful to do your work well and thoroughly.
fact: Conscientious also means guided by what you believe is right and wrong.
fact: Conscientiously is the adverb: she checked her spelling conscientiously.
fact: A conscientious objector is a person who refuses to fight in a war because they believe it is wrong.
fact: Conscientiousness is the noun: it means the quality of being conscientious.
exercise: «School reports use formal words: "conscientious" means careful and hard-working.» What does conscientious mean? | Careless and in a rush | Loud and cheerful | *Careful and hard-working | Lost and confused
exercise: Mia checks every answer twice and hands in her homework early every week. What does this show about Mia? | She is curt with everyone | She is glum and miserable | She dislikes all homework | *She is conscientious, because she takes care over her work
exercise: In history, what is a conscientious objector? | Someone who builds castles for an army | Someone who writes the news for soldiers | Someone who fights bravely in every battle | *Someone who refuses to fight in a war because they believe it is wrong
test: Which word means the quality of being careful and hard-working? | *Conscientiousness | Conscientiously | Objector | Conscientious
test: Ravi is a conscientious worker. Which sentence uses the word correctly? | *Ravi worked conscientiously on his project, checking each step | Ravi conscientiously ate his lunch in a hurry | Ravi was a conscientious dog that barked at the post | Ravi was conscientious about losing his pencil case every day
exam: «She is a conscientious pupil.» Which word is closest in meaning to conscientious? | Careless | Loud | *Careful | Lazy
